{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016224458336-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016225536\"/><p>黃金泳灘有人溺斃。</p><p>屯門有人遇溺。今日(16日)傍晚6時23分，有市民致電報案，指一名女子倒臥黃金泳灘近岸邊，懷疑遇溺陷入昏迷。</p><p>救援人員接報抵達，女子依然沒有反應，立即將其送往屯門醫院搶救，於晚上8時17分證實死亡。死者死因有待驗屍後確定。警方現正追查事發原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:59:03.559182+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:44:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T15:17:43.310271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:57:37.787033+00:00","content_hash":"909ed08556d9592bea80f8d38a128125a363ee442a015eedb3130745890f33ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}